    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The flight times seem a bit optimistic if you factor in the commute to the airport and security. Also, just to clarify, is there a big difference in reliability between the two? I'm worried about delays messing up my meetings. Which one would you recommend for someone who can't afford to be late?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
