      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right, flight times can be affected by check-in, security, and potential layovers, adding 1-2 hours to the overall travel time. \n\nRegarding reliability, both options are extremely reliable, but with the Shinkansen, you're less likely to encounter flight cancellations if there are any. While flight delays and cancellations do occur, train departures are generally more on-time.\n\nGiven that you're concerned about not being late for your meetings, I would recommend taking the Shinkansen for both legs. It's a more reliable option that provides a faster and more controlled travel experience, eliminating the risk of cancellations or flight disruptions.",
